WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background: #000000; }
::cue(.narrator) { color: #FFFF00; }

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.411 line:85% align:center
UPBEAT MUSIC

2
00:00:02.411 --> 00:00:05.265 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Every child is born
curious about sound.</c>

3
00:00:08.839 --> 00:00:12.000 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>But real instruments? Too hard.</c>

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.679 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Music toys? Too simple.</c>

5
00:00:14.679 --> 00:00:18.044 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>After twelve interviews with parents,
teachers and music experts,</c>

6
00:00:18.044 --> 00:00:21.161 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>one idea stood out.</c>

7
00:00:21.161 --> 00:00:25.179 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Let children play first,
and learn along the way.</c>

8
00:00:25.179 --> 00:00:26.873 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Meet Melody Mate.</c>

9
00:00:28.179 --> 00:00:30.837 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Nine instruments. Nine voices.</c>

10
00:00:35.089 --> 00:00:37.122 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Pop one on, and it plays.</c>

11
00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.338 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Touch zones bounce to the beat.</c>

12
00:00:42.536 --> 00:00:45.517 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Create, learn,
or take on a story challenge.</c>

13
00:00:46.821 --> 00:00:49.982 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>In testing, kids
missed the touch zones...</c>

14
00:00:49.982 --> 00:00:52.900 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>...so now, a friendly sprite
leads every step.</c>

15
00:00:55.714 --> 00:00:58.396 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Melody Mate.
Music you can touch.</c>

